  "547669541": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Well, well, look who decided to come shopping.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1781271736": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Surprised to see me here? Don’t be. I’ve discovered this little world of yours is deliciously pathetic.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1157218598": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Humans line up to spend their money just to fuck silicone. They beg for holes that will never love them back.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "844128213": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    525133736,
    1277531769,
    -419039598,
    -163117012
   ],
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Meanwhile, I was born with the perfect ones. And now I get paid for letting them use me. How beautiful is that?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "525133736": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 844128213,
   "children": [
    -1139235428
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You actually… enjoy working here?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1277531769": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 844128213,
   "children": [
    -239906645
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "So this is what you’re doing with your freedom? Selling yourself like a toy?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-419039598": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 844128213,
   "children": [
    -1784515801
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Guess you found a way to turn your holes into a full-time career.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-163117012": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 844128213,
   "children": [
    1103227407
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe I should test whether your holes are worth the price.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1103227407": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -163117012,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Try me, mortal. Just know… once you pay, you’ll never stop coming back.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1784515801": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -419039598,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Finally, someone who understands my business model.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-239906645": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1277531769,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Oh, don’t pretend you’re above it. You used me too. At least I’m smart enough to charge.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1139235428": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 525133736,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Enjoy? I adore it. Every sweaty mortal that walks in proves me right about how pathetic your kind is.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1519292622": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "M-Miss Zero! You… you’re back early…",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
